WEBVTT

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.760
And in exchange for that,

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.580
we'll connect our hands

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:42.710
And that, too,

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.550
will shine

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.060
Thank you for watching!

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:47.360
For a long, long, long, long time

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:26.420
重力下眠りにつく千年に一度の今日 太陽の四角に立ち 僕らこの星を出よう 冷ました時連れ 元場所へ 星へ Go

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:03.620
The summer comes even earlier

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:10.500
In the dazzling scenery

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:16.340
You're the only one who stops

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:38.510
I longed for the earth

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:59.030
I'll crush it, force it, and leave this planet

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.720
When you wake up, tell me where you can't take me back
